      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Charles%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Saturdays and Sundays, costumed Legends characters and the Lewis & Clark Fife and Drum Corps join the Santa Parade to the First Missouri State Capitol.",
